Thy precepts holy, and slighted Thy word;
Bid not Thy wrath in its terrors awaken;
Give to us peace, O most merciful Lord."}, {"stanza": 3, "lyrics": "God the all righteousness One! man hath defied Thee;
Yet to eternity standeth Thy word;
Falsehood and wrong shall not tarry beside Thee;
Prosper the right, O most merciful Lord."}, {"stanza": 4, "lyrics": "So shall we render Thee thankful devotion,
