when dangers fierce your path assail,
God will take care of you."}, {"stanza": 3, "lyrics": "All you may need he will provide,
God will take care of you;
nothing you ask will be denied,
God will take care of you."}, {"stanza": 4, "lyrics": "No matter what may be the test,
God will take care of you;
lean, weary one, upon his breast,
God will take care of you."}]

