But His love abideth ever,
Through eternal years the same."}, {"stanza": 2, "lyrics": "Take the world, but give me Jesus,
Sweetest comfort of my soul;
With my Saviour watching o’er me,
I can sing, though billows roll."}, {"stanza": 3, "lyrics": "Take the world, but give me Jesus;
Let me view his constant smile;
Then throughout my pilgrim journey
