verses.lyrics:
Never leave me, nor forsake me;
Ever be my friend;
For I need Thee from life’s dawning
To its end.

hymns.verses_json:
[{"stanza": 1, "lyrics": "Be Thou my Vision, O Lord of my heart;
Naught be all else to me, save that Thou art
